&lt;p&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;   D. Other&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   The CMS has determined that a national coverage determination (NCD) for pulmonary rehabilitation is not appropriate at this time. Local Medicare Administrative Contractors should continue to make decisions under &amp;sect;1862(a)(1)(A) of the Act through their local coverage determination (LCD) process or by case-by-case adjudication. See Heckler v. Ringer, 466 U.S. 602, 617 (1984) (Recognizing that the Secretary has discretion to either establish a generally applicable rule or to allow individual adjudication.). See also, 68 Fed. Reg. 63692, 63693 (November 7, 2003). LCDs can be accessed from the CMS search engine located at: &lt;a href=&quot;https:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;medicare-coverage-database&sol;new-search&sol;search.aspx&quot;&gt;http:&sol;&sol;www.cms.gov&sol;mcd&sol;search.asp&lt;&sol;a&gt;.&lt;&sol;p&gt;

